invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_sign64.c
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: the signer includes rsa_ifma.h, the first step to a call into the
  public operation's AVX-512 IFMA kernel that does not go through
  rsa_vp1_cpu, which picks the kernel from the session's value, and that
  the signer does not follow with its wipes. The script requires that no
  root source but rsa_mont.c and rsa_ifma_sign.c includes rsa_ifma.h.

--- old
#include "ch_assert.h"
#include "cpu_cfg.h"
#include "ct.h"
--- new
#include "ch_assert.h"
#include "cpu_cfg.h"
#include "ct.h"
#include "rsa_ifma.h"
